Package: rsxr
Title: R Bindings for the rsx RAD-seq Sex-Determination Toolkit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rohit", "Goswami", email = "rgoswami@ieee.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2393-8056")),
    person("Ruhila", "Goswami", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5443-9356")))
Description: A thin, ergonomic R interface to rsx, a high-performance
    streaming toolkit for RAD-seq sex determination. The package binds the
    rsx C API directly through R's native C interface (no intermediate
    process), exposing the process, freq, distrib, signif, triage, depth,
    merge, and pca commands, and a tibble-returning high-level 'marker_table'
    workflow.
